sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant Client as Next.js Client
    participant API as Route /api/sources
    participant Neon as Neon Postgres
    participant Inngest as Inngest Event Bus
    participant Worker as Inngest Step Worker
    participant Cloudinary as Cloudinary Storage (Temporary)
    participant Extractor as Parser / Firecrawl / YT Captions
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI Embeddings
    participant Qdrant as Qdrant Vector Store

    User->>Client: Upload PDF / Paste URL / Submit YouTube
    Client->>API: POST /api/sources (FormData / JSON)
    API->>Neon: INSERT source (status='queued')
    opt If File Source
        API->>Neon: INSERT telemetry_file_uploads (fileType, fileSizeBytes)
    end
    API->>Inngest: inngest.send("source.ingest.*", { sourceId, userId, ... })
    API-->>Client: 201 Created { sourceId, status: "queued" }
    Client->>Client: Render SourceCard with 'queued' pill

    Note over Inngest,Worker: Inngest Asynchronous Execution (concurrency: 2/user)
    Inngest->>Worker: Dispatch Step 1: extract-raw-content
    Worker->>Neon: UPDATE source SET status='indexing'
    Client->>Client: SourceCard badge transitions to 'indexing' (orbital spin)

    alt Web Source
        Worker->>Extractor: Scrape clean markdown via Firecrawl
    else PDF Source
        Worker->>Cloudinary: Fetch temporary uploaded PDF binary
        Worker->>Extractor: Extract page text via pure-JS PDFPageExtractor
    else YouTube Source
        Worker->>Extractor: Fetch subtitle cues via keyless youtube-transcript
    else Subtitle Source
        Worker->>Extractor: Parse .srt / .vtt timecode cues
    end
    Extractor-->>Worker: Raw extracted content

    Note over Worker: Universal Intermediate Format: Markdown
    Worker->>Worker: Step 2: normalize-to-intermediate-markdown (with <!-- page: N --> or <!-- time: mm:ss -->)
    Worker->>Worker: Step 3: chunk-intermediate-markdown (~500 token segments + type metadata)
    
    Worker->>OpenAI: Step 4: generate-embeddings (batch <= 20 chunks)
    OpenAI-->>Worker: Vector embeddings (1536d)

    Worker->>Qdrant: Step 5: index-qdrant (upsert points into unified contextual_chunks_v1)
    Qdrant-->>Worker: Upsert confirmed

    opt PDF Source
        Worker->>Cloudinary: Step 6: delete-temp-binary (purge ephemeral upload from Cloudinary)
        Cloudinary-->>Worker: Ephemeral binary purged
    end

    Worker->>Neon: Step 7: update-neon-status (status='ready', chunkCount=N)
    Client->>Client: SourceCard badge transitions to 'ready' (success glow)

    opt Failure Isolation (Retries exhausted or deterministic error)
        Worker->>Cloudinary: Purge temporary binary if exists
        Worker->>Neon: onFailure: UPDATE source SET status='failed', error_reason=$msg
        Client->>Client: SourceCard badge transitions to 'failed' (red border + tooltip)
    end
